<title>LATVIA: GOVERNMENT LIST (970807).</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST (970807).</headline>
<text>
<p>LATVIA GOVERNMENT LIST (970807)</p>
<p> President.....................................Guntis ULMANIS</p>
<p>(Re-elected 18 June 96 for a second term)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>CABINET (Confirmed 7 Aug 1997 - see end of list for party</p>
<p>	    affiliations)</p>
<p> Prime Minister.......................Guntar KRASTS (FF/LNNK)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister...................Juris KAKSITIS (DPS)</p>
<p> Deputy Prime Minister.................Anatoly GORBUNOVS (LW)</p>
<p>(also Minister for Environment Protection &amp; Regional</p>
<p>Development)</p>
<p>				- - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS</p>
<p> Agriculture..........................Andris RAVINSH (FU/UCD)</p>
<p> Culture..............................Ramona UMBLIJA (FU/UCD)</p>
<p> Defence..............................Talavs JUNDZIS (FU/UCD)</p>
<p> Economy.................................Atis SAUSNITIS (DPS)</p>
<p> Education &amp; Science.....................Juris CELMINSH (DPS)</p>
<p>Environment Protection &amp; Regional</p>
<p>     Development...............................See Deputy Pms</p>
<p> Finance................................Robert ZILE (FF/LNNK)</p>
<p> Foreign..................................Valdis BIRKAVS (LW)</p>
<p> Interior.............................Ziednonis CHEVERS (DPS)</p>
<p> Justice............................Dzintar RASNACH (FF/LNNK)</p>
<p> Transport.............................Vilis KRISHTOPANS (LW)</p>
<p> Welfare...........................Vladimir MAKAROV (FF/LNNK)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>STATE MINISTERS</p>
<p>Environment Protection &amp; Regional</p>
<p>    Development.........................Indulis EMSIS (Green)</p>
<p> Healthcare.........................Viktors JAKSONS (FF/LNNK)</p>
<p> Local government............................Erik ZUNDA (DPS)</p>
<p> Revenue......................................Aija POCHA (LW)</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Speaker of Parliament........................Alfred CHEPANIS</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS</p>
<p>DPS -- Democratic Party Saimnieks</p>
<p>FF/LNNK -- For Fatherland and Freedom/Latvian National</p>
<p>		Indepence Movement merged party</p>
<p>FU/UCD -- Farmers Union/Union of Christian Democrats</p>
<p>	     (form one parliamentary faction but run in</p>
<p>	     elections as separate parties)</p>
<p>LW -- Latvia's Way</p>
<p>NOTE - The Green Party is not a member of the government</p>
<p>	  coalition but has said it will support it and one</p>
<p>	  of its members has been co-opted into the government.</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank President.........................Einars REPSHE</p>
<p>			     - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NOTE: Any comments/queries on the content of this</p>
<p>		 government list, please contact the Reuter</p>
<p>		 Editorial Reference Unit, London, on (171) 542</p>
<p>		 7968.</p>
<p>			  (End government list)</p>
</text>
